        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ea9f66c583214389a27bd85f539c771a",
      "statement": "After a successful Docling extraction the parent re-opens the PDF with pdfplumber for table/image typing and image bounding boxes, because Docling's markdown export with picture generation disabled supplies no geometry — this is what keeps the image enrichment path functional on the Docling route.",
