      "id": "claim_2aabf1b69e5f43f9ba8d5264fd550e22",
      "statement": "Docling-route image placeholders are emitted in the same [[IMAGE:p=..;idx=..]] format the legacy chain produces, so downstream stages consume an identical ParsedDoc regardless of which parser produced it.",
