        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e25943c7f44d452b87b78855fd96e157",
      "statement": "Table flattening is invisible to every text-quality measure cqg computes — the flattened output shows negligible cid corruption and otherwise healthy signals — so the parser choice cannot be substituted for by the confidence and signal machinery.",
